    "top_keyword_score": 0.5,
    "top_section": "REMOTE WORK POLICY",
    "retrieval_seconds": 0.4754611170064891,
    "answer_seconds": 4.933621632997529,
    "total_seconds": 5.409113968009478,
    "answer": "Under **Remote Work Policy**, remote days must be agreed with the direct manager in advance, and working outside the country of employment requires prior written approval from HR and Legal.\n\nUnder **Data Privacy and GDPR Compliance**, all cross-border personal-data transfers require DPO approval at dpo@acme.com; if data is transferred outside the EEA, an approved mechanism\u2014SCCs, an adequacy decision, or BCRs\u2014must be used. Under **Information Security Policy** and **Acceptable Use Policy**, data in transit must use TLS 1.2 or higher, data at rest must use AES-256, the laptop must have full-disk encryption, and sensitive data must not be stored on personal devices or sent through personal email.",
