    "retrieval_seconds": 0.39235509299032856,
    "answer_seconds": 6.739067269008956,
    "total_seconds": 7.131443863007007,
    "answer": "- Under **Incident Response Policy** and **SLA and Uptime**, engage/acknowledge the P1 incident within 15 minutes and contain it within 1 hour. The policy does not specify API-specific containment steps.\n- Under **Incident Response Policy**, notify the GDPR supervisory authority within 72 hours because personal data is involved. Notify affected individuals without undue delay if the risk is high. State breach-notification deadlines vary by jurisdiction from 14\u201390 days; SEC/FinCEN notification is required within 30 days if applicable to a financial-data breach.\n- Under **Incident Response Policy**, report the incident immediately to **security@acme.com** or the 24/7 Security Hotline at **1-800-555-CERT**.",
