    "answer_seconds": 1.7022922869946342,
    "total_seconds": 2.0808045140001923,
    "answer": "HTTP 429 means the API rate limit has been exceeded. Under **Rate Limiting**, wait the number of seconds specified in the `Retry-After` header, then retry using exponential backoff with jitter\u2014do not retry immediately. The `X-RateLimit-Reset` header also shows the reset time as a Unix timestamp.\n\nUnder **API Authentication**, the OAuth access token is valid for 3,600 seconds (1 hour).",
